mode: "100644"
text: "# Placement, hub structure + two worked examples\n\n## Placement + destination cheat-sheet\n| Platform | Link placement | Best destination (intent) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Instagram | bio + Stories sticker + verbal CTA | lead magnet → email capture |\n| TikTok | bio (1k+ followers) + verbal CTA | lead magnet / product (TikTok Shop) |\n| X | **first comment** (or bio) | one specific page (tool/newsletter/product) |\n| LinkedIn | **first comment** / Featured | booking / lead capture (high-value) |\n| Facebook | **first comment** | lead magnet / event / native Shop |\n| Pinterest | **link-out** on the pin | the exact relevant page (not homepage) |\n| YouTube | description + pinned comment + About | deeper content / video-specific URL |\n\n## The capture funnel (capture before sell)\n```\nContent (hook, value) -> CTA (\"free [lead magnet] -> link\") -> landing page (one promise, email field)\n-> deliver the magnet -> nurture (email/newsletter) -> offer later\n```\nPrimary CTA = the **lead magnet**, not the product. Value crystal clear on screen one.\n\n## Bio-hub structure (when a hub is warranted)\n1 **primary** CTA (the current priority — capture or launch) + **2–3 prioritized** secondary links\n(newsletter, top product, best content). No graveyard. Mobile-first, high-contrast buttons, current\noffers only. Rotate the primary weekly.\n\n## UTM scheme (so you can see what converts)\n`utm_source=instagram` · `utm_medium=bio` (or `story`, `comment`, `description`) ·\n`utm_campaign=<offer>` · `utm_content=<post-or-video-id>`. Use a **branded short link**; read results in\n**GA4** + the link tool. (A/B test the highest-traffic hub — ties `experimentation-and-ab-testing`.)\n\n## Worked example 1 — IG lead-magnet capture (blunt indie-founder voice)\n```\nGOAL: grow the email list (owned).   PLATFORM: Instagram.\nPOST CTA: \"Free 1-page freelance tax checklist. Link in bio.\" (verbal + caption)\nBIO LINK: a single landing page -> one promise + email field -> deliver the checklist.\nTRACK: branded short link, utm_campaign=tax-checklist. Rotate to next magnet in 2 weeks. -> email-and-newsletter\n```\n\n## Worked example 2 — X single-destination (warm studio voice, link in first comment)\n```\nGOAL: newsletter sign-ups.   PLATFORM: X (links suppressed in-post).\nPOST: a punchy, genuinely useful take (native, no link). \nFIRST COMMENT: \"The full calm-bookkeeping checklist + monthly note -> [branded short link]\"\nDESTINATION: a one-promise newsletter page (no multi-step funnel — X bounces on funnels).\nTRACK: utm_source=x, utm_medium=comment. -> social-strategy / experimentation\n```\n\nBoth: owned-audience goal; one clear action; capture before sell; correct placement; branded short link\n+ UTM; conversions read from GA4/the link tool (never fabricated). WoopSocial publishes the driving\nposts; the hub/landing/email tools are external.\n"
